WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.260 --> 00:00:05.260
Another thing Dr. Bright is not allowed to
do at the Foundation: No playing Chicken!

00:00:05.260 --> 00:00:10.040
Playing "chicken" is defined as a test of
courage in which two parties engage in mutual

00:00:10.040 --> 00:00:13.340
challenges, waiting for the other person to
back down first.

00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:18.820
Dr. Bright's version of chicken tends to involve
climbing onto SCP-682's back, daring one of

00:00:18.820 --> 00:00:24.369
his colleagues to climb atop another dangerous
SCP, and ride them toward each other to "see

00:00:24.369 --> 00:00:25.470
what happens."

00:00:25.470 --> 00:00:29.870
This is strictly prohibited, and Dr. Bright
is no longer allowed to play Chicken with

00:00:29.870 --> 00:00:32.180
any department at the Foundation.

00:00:32.180 --> 00:00:34.960
Don't say yes if he asks you to play chicken.

00:00:34.960 --> 00:00:37.670
Don't even agree if he offers you some fried
chicken.

00:00:37.670 --> 00:00:39.229
Who knows what he's up to?

